		{
			title: "Lord Fungus"
			x: 1.0d
			y: -1.75d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5King Shroomus is the boss of Mysterium, Bandit, but unlike Vinocorne in Gardencia, they are not the natural protector of this world."
				""
				"&dInstead, the FOP created King Shroomus to rule over the Gorbs, the peaceful citizens of Mysterium, as well as all the various shroomic flora and fauna. "
				""
				"&5King Shroomus used to be one of the many researchers employed by the FOP. He oversaw multiple labs, one of them had a heavy focus in mycology, or mushroom study. "
				""
				"&dThe studies enamored him, and he became obsessed with mushrooms. Changed the focus of all his labs to mushrooms. For everything. Food, medicine, building, weapons, whatever he could convince the FOP board would be profitable."
				""
				"&5It's no wonder that he was given the boss position for a mushroom world."
			]
			dependencies: ["32F6AB44FB7E3DD4"]
			id: "29F2FFF875244B7D"
			tasks: [{
				id: "00DBEBCC9353C5A7"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "King of Mushrooms"
			x: 3.25d
			y: -1.75d
			shape: "hexagon"
			description: [
				"&5When he took over as King Shroomis, he became known as the Mushroom Monster as it only increased his infatuation with mushrooms to the limits."
				""
				"&dAt least with the limits of the Mysterium populace. But his infatuation with mushrooms makes it easy to both face him or placate him."
				""
				"&5Either way you'll need to make a Shroom Stone to get his attention."
				""
				"&dJust don't drop it on the Mysterium floor. It'll alert him before you are ready!"
			]
			dependencies: ["29F2FFF875244B7D"]
			id: "1DCF2210691E51D6"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6C2DEA2445B0B9E7"
				type: "item"
