		}
		{
			title: "Topple the King"
			x: 4.75d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&5Facing King Shroomus will be a tough one, due to all the various fungal effects that he has learned and incorporated into his monstrous shroom body."
				""
				"&dHis projectiles not only cause a variety of ailments like nausea or poison, he can also regenerate his heath now and then."
				""
				"&5But if you think you are ready to face him, take that Shroom Stone and chuck it on the ground anywhere in Mysteirum."
				""
				"&dAnd if you manage to defeat him, he has a chance of dropping a shroom based staff or sword."
