		{
			title: "Of Many Toxins"
			x: -6.75d
			y: 3.25d
			shape: "diamond"
			description: [
				"&5The Vox Ponds is a... dieing world. Or would be starting to live again if it hadn't been digitized into the FOP Game Server."
				""
				"&dPost apocalyptic worlds are a big draw to the FOP. Strange mutations, new toxic compounds to take advantage of. A barely surviving, struggling populace to string along and exploit."
				""
				"&5The world would probably bounce back after a couple hundred years, if given the chance. Wouldn't be the first time, wouldn't be the last."
				""
				"&dHopefully we can give these worlds a chance again. First though, we need to get to Vox Ponds. You'll want to get yourself a FULL Hazmat Armor suit."
				""
				"&5Wear it, and bring a blank Realmstone to a Banker or Explosives Expert in Creeponia. Right Click the Realmstone onto the NPC, and they'll tell you a story and give you a Vox Ponds Realmstone in return."
			]
			dependencies: ["0F2B296548FC8B14"]
			id: "771EC1131973FF59"
			tasks: [{
