			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Land of Apocalypse"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 3.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			description: [
				"&5Welcome to the apocalypse, Bandit. Or, well, after it."
				""
				"&dWorlds like these tend to be like this from their own machinations. Or, well, some of the denizens machinations. Nuclear war, technological disaster, lot of ways for a planet to find the apocalypse."
				""
				"&5I suggest keeping that hazmat suit on. Or something similar. You'll probably find something the populace uses to survive in the highly toxic envionment."
				""
				"&dWhat creatures left  that haven't mutated are either hardy, wary sentient beings, or robots. Keep your guard up, Bandit."
			]
			dependencies: ["771EC1131973FF59"]
