				""
				"&dSee, their bodies have evolved and mutated, and are able to filter out the Toxins and utilize them in some way. The FOP are quite interested in these toxins, as they say there's nothing quite like an apocalypse for new tech."
				""
				"&5Though, note, only the FOP says that. Tells you all you need to know, yeah? Those creatures all can drop a 'toxic lump', a collection of filtered toxins. Careful when handling them, Bandit. "
